  refine' ⟨ round ( ( n : ℝ ) / m ), _, _ ⟩ <;> simp_all +decide [ medJ, medFiber ];
  · -- From `hmW` (unfold `medWindow`, `Finset.mem_filter`, `Finset.mem_Ioo`): `(k:ℤ) < m` and `(m:ℝ) < (k:ℝ)+(k:ℝ)^theta`. So `(k:ℝ) < (m:ℝ)` and `(m:ℝ) > 0`.
